<title>UK: BNG sets $200 million four-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>BNG sets $200 million four-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>lead manager Paribas Capital Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NV BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     5.875     MATURITY    27.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.34    PAY DATE    27.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.94     SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX/AMST  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NETHS     HOME CTRY  NETHS     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED CURVE -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
